# Cloudflare Pages redirects/rewrites.
#
# NOTE (2026-09-16): Pages evaluates _redirects BEFORE static assets — a
# wildcard 200 rewrite swallows real files. The per-workout / per-program
# detail pages are generated as static files at build time
# (workouts/<slug>.html, programs/<slug>.html), so there must be NO
# /workouts/* or /programs/* rewrite rules here, or every detail URL serves
# the generic shell instead of its own page. Unknown slugs now 404 (honest
# for SEO); the generic /workout and /program resolver pages still exist
# and are linked from llms.txt.
# (Rewriting to the extensionless /workout and /program avoids Cloudflare's
# .html -> pretty-URL 308, which would strip the slug from the address bar.)

# Removed pages (301 to home so old links don't 404).
/why-kohlrabi  /  301
/why-kohlrabi.html  /  301
